# Decompiled Starfield UI assets (JPEXS output from hudmenu.gfx). Kept
# locally as a working reference, deliberately never committed: it is
# Bethesda's copyrighted content, not ours to redistribute under this
# repository's licence. Everything actually learned from it is written
# up in docs/FINDINGS.md and in the relevant source comments, so nothing
# here is needed to build or understand the mod. Regenerate it with
# JPEXS from your own game files if you need to look something up.
